/13/9818526/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カーキのワンピース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しくカジュアルだから\n皆んなに驚かれた！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部 3部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青のワンピースに白のパンプス。\n2部はこれにプラスカーディガン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってな感じでした(*^_^*)\n皆さんはどれが好きだったかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話の内容としては\n12枚目シングルのことが\n圧倒的に多くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのほかにも\nまいちゅんカフェ\nOL生活\n乃木坂カフェ\nNOGIBINGO\n乃木坂工事中\nモバメ\nなどなど\nいろんなお話しができて\n楽しかったですV(^_^)V"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東の個別握手会はこれからしばらく\nないから少しさみしいですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会が7月にあるので、\nまたそこでお会いしましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！\n明日は遂に11枚目シングル最後の個握！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なに着ようかな〜〜？？\nなに話そうかな〜〜？？\n楽しみだな〜〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋で待ってますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミューコミ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週の月曜日はミューコミ＋プラスに\nゲストとして真夏さんとかなさんと\n出させて頂きました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","s